        },
        {
          "text": "2Anzi Daudini ndra otile Hebiro­nia ’diyi yi ’di: mva okori Ami­noni, Ahinoamu Yezireeli zini tileri’i; iriri Danieli, Abigaili Karimeli zini tileri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
